airfoil, creating an iced profile. At the next time step, assuming that the ice is not shed, the iced
profile is input into LEWICE to accrete more ice. This procedure is repeated until ice sheds, after
which the clean airfoil geometry is used and the process repeats. A schematic of this is shown in
